@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@tenantId = demo
@domainCode = DEFAULT
@applicationCode = ASSET_MAINTENANCE
@documentId = replace-with-runtime-document-id

### Sync policies return metadata-driven offline entities
GET {{baseUrl}}/sync/policies
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
x-domain-code: {{domainCode}}
x-application-code: {{applicationCode}}
x-user-id: mobile-tech
x-roles: TECHNICIAN
x-permissions: WORK_ORDER.READ,WORK_ORDER.COMPLETE,ASSET.READ

### Expected
### WORK_ORDER_SYNC -> OFFLINE_FIRST, MANUAL_REVIEW
### ASSET_SYNC -> CACHE_ONLY, SERVER_WINS
### STOCK_BALANCE_SYNC is not returned because offlineEnabled=false

### Mobile bootstrap package
POST {{baseUrl}}/sync/bootstrap
content-type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
x-domain-code: {{domainCode}}
x-application-code: {{applicationCode}}
x-user-id: mobile-tech
x-roles: TECHNICIAN
x-permissions: WORK_ORDER.READ,WORK_ORDER.COMPLETE,ASSET.READ

{
  "deviceId": "mobile-device-001",
  "metadataVersion": 0
}

### Expected
### metadataVersion exists
### entities includes WORK_ORDER and ASSET
### forms includes WORK_ORDER_FORM
### navigation includes MAIN_NAVIGATION and MOBILE_NAV
### theme includes DEFAULT_THEME and COMPACT_THEME
### experience includes WORK_ORDER_EXPERIENCE and ASSET_EXPERIENCE

### Offline replay still calls Runtime API
POST {{baseUrl}}/runtime/WORK_ORDER/{{documentId}}/actions/COMPLETE
content-type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
x-domain-code: {{domainCode}}
x-application-code: {{applicationCode}}
x-user-id: mobile-tech
x-roles: TECHNICIAN
x-permissions: WORK_ORDER.READ,WORK_ORDER.COMPLETE,ASSET.READ

{
  "source": "OFFLINE_SYNC",
  "payload": {
    "photo": "file001"
  }
}

### Expected trace
### ACTION -> SECURITY -> SECURITY_POLICY -> WORKFLOW -> PROCESS -> BUSINESS -> EVENT -> LEDGER -> SYNC_REPLAY
